{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born of the Norns\u2019 myths, our journey begins. We awaken in Midgard, torn from a dream in which we fall from Asgard. Through the roots and branches of Yggdrasil, our fate unfolds \u2013 every deed and every decision shaping the course of the world and inevitably leading to one of two endings: to defy Ragnar\u00f6k or to bring about the end of all things. Along this path we wield swords, axes, and bows of immense power. Arrows, potions, and supplies determine victory or defeat. Odin\u2019s companions emerge from the shadows, enchanted springs unleash new strength, and mighty bosses put our courage to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the path lie hidden treasures and ancient riddles \u2013 secrets that whisper of worlds long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed exclusively for VR, the game delivers precise hit detection, realistic physics, and the full-bodied presence of creatures. Weapons are not only tools of attack, but can also move objects, deflect strikes, or even block arrows in flight \u2013 turning every encounter into an intense, tangible experience. Soar with Huginn, ride Sleipnir, and fight alongside Freki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragnar\u00f6k \u2013 often mistaken for the \u201cTwilight of the Gods.\u201d In truth, it means \u201cthe fate of the gods\u201d; not merely an end, but the inevitable course of cosmic destiny, as told in the myths.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First visit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994440/c4467412749037d4dc45b67750cf5caa4546fb64.jpg"},{"name":"All elements found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994440/c4467412749037d4dc45b67750cf5caa4546fb64.jpg"},{"name":"All companions accompany","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994440/c4467412749037d4dc45b67750cf5caa